{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i", "title": "梁惠王上", "description": "孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "乘", "id": "乘"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "刑", "id": "刑"}, {"form": "利", "id": "利"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "孝悌", "id": "孝悌"}, {"form": "家", "id": "家"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "敵", "id": "敵"}, {"form": "日", "id": "日"}, {"form": "步", "id": "步"}, {"form": "義", "variants": [], "id": "義"}, {"form": "賢者", "id": "賢者"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.784189633918261, "source": "乘", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.9732594177019327, "source": "乘", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 3.5610460826040513, "source": "乘", "target": "家"}, {"weight": 2.2801122371419873, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.2992829841302609, "source": "義", "target": "利"}, {"weight": 1.7692866133759964, "source": "義", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 1.992430164690206, "source": "義", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.9732594177019327, "source": "義", "target": "孝悌"}, {"weight": 1.992430164690206, "source": "國", "target": "利"}, {"weight": 2.2801122371419873, "source": "國", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.056968685827777, "source": "國", "target": "家"}, {"weight": 1.363821505267832, "source": "國", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 2.8678989020441064, "source": "君", "target": "家"}, {"weight": 1.4816045409242156, "source": "君", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 2.174751721484161, "source": "君", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 1.4816045409242156, "source": "家", "target": "利"}, {"weight": 3.378724525810097, "source": "日", "target": "孝悌"}, {"weight": 0.7884573603642703, "source": "後", "target": "利"}, {"weight": 1.76928